# Whack-a-mole: every mole whacked over a round of 45 s: a score, no stray whacks; then over, and its tickets.
# A round stopped with PLAY pays none
wait 800
turn SELECT 1
wait 400
expect cab 2
tap PLAY
wait 100
shot stand.png
autowhack on
tap PLAY
wait 10000
shot playing.png
expect whack_score >10
wait 37000
expect whack_state 2
expect whack_stray 0
expect won 32
shot over.png
tap PLAY
wait 5000
expect whack_state 1
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect whack_state 0
expect won 32
